WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.010
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:46.280 --> 01:47.200
The hospital called.

3
01:49.400 --> 01:49.879
Captain Bai.

4
01:51.439 --> 01:53.159
Xu Duoduo just succumbed to his injuries.

5
01:54.120 --> 01:55.359
And about him being wiretapped,

6
01:55.640 --> 01:56.599
Li Qiang probably found out.

7
01:56.680 --> 01:57.519
How did you confirm that?

8
01:58.040 --> 01:59.760
I asked him if he had anything to tell me,

9
01:59.959 --> 02:01.000
and he only mentioned Tian Xin.

10
02:01.599 --> 02:02.120
Understood.

11
02:04.680 --> 02:06.159
Xu Duoduo succumbed to his injuries.

12
02:06.480 --> 02:09.319
Also, he only mentioned Tian Xin before he died.

13
02:09.879 --> 02:10.639
Tian Xin?

14
02:11.240 --> 02:13.639
The woman wiretapping with Li Xiao.

15
02:16.120 --> 02:16.560
By the way,

16
02:17.680 --> 02:20.120
Li Xiao mentioned that Tian Xin's father

17
02:20.439 --> 02:21.960
was an old comrade of yours,

18
02:22.319 --> 02:23.039
named Tian Zheng.

19
02:23.319 --> 02:23.840
What a coincidence.

20
02:27.560 --> 02:29.319
Before Xu Duoduo died,

21
02:29.360 --> 02:30.680
why would he mention Tian Xin?

22
02:33.680 --> 02:34.439
I'm not quite sure.

23
02:34.759 --> 02:37.039
But based on what we've gathered,

24
02:37.759 --> 02:39.599
Xu Duoduo likely had a crush on her.

25
02:41.000 --> 02:41.759
I see.

26
02:42.520 --> 02:44.400
Send officers to Xu Duoduo's house immediately.

27
02:44.400 --> 02:45.400
Search it thoroughly.

28
02:45.639 --> 02:47.199
See if we can find any clues.

29
02:47.319 --> 02:47.599
Yes, sir.

30
02:51.919 --> 02:53.360
Send me Tian Xin's address later.

31
02:53.879 --> 02:56.080
I'd like to meet my old comrade's daughter, too.

32
03:08.280 --> 03:09.360
It's been over ten years.

33
03:26.120 --> 03:26.759
Stop!

34
03:27.800 --> 03:28.439
Out of the way!

35
03:28.680 --> 03:30.439
Stop! Don't run!

36
03:30.680 --> 03:31.800
Freeze! Don't run!

37
03:32.240 --> 03:32.960
Don't run! Freeze!

38
03:35.919 --> 03:36.439
Let go of me!

39
03:36.639 --> 03:37.199
What are you doing?

40
03:53.400 --> 03:53.879
You're back.

41
03:58.319 --> 03:59.919
According to Qian Feng's two mistresses,

42
03:59.919 --> 04:01.599
especially Gao Min's confession,

43
04:01.800 --> 04:03.120
every weekend, Qian Feng

44
04:03.120 --> 04:05.000
has something very important to handle.

45
04:05.280 --> 04:06.280
We previously suspected

46
04:06.280 --> 04:07.719
that on weekends, Qian Feng

47
04:07.719 --> 04:09.159
was making deals with drug traffickers.

48
04:09.680 --> 04:12.439
But Qian Feng's cash withdrawals through Li Xia

49
04:12.439 --> 04:13.479
were usually on Tuesdays.

50
04:14.919 --> 04:15.919
If that money

51
04:15.919 --> 04:17.399
was used to pay his Supplier,

52
04:17.399 --> 04:18.360
I don't think it makes sense

53
04:18.360 --> 04:20.399
that he would wait until the weekend to pay.

54
04:21.199 --> 04:22.360
The leads you just mentioned—

55
04:22.759 --> 04:23.879
Ge Dan already found them.

56
04:24.480 --> 04:25.160
Anything else?

57
04:29.639 --> 04:31.839
On the Alipay account Qian Feng registered under Li Xia,

58
04:32.040 --> 04:34.199
besides receiving drug money and withdrawing cash,

59
04:34.199 --> 04:36.199
there are plenty of records for daily expenses.

60
04:36.199 --> 04:38.279
For example, purchases at supermarkets

61
04:38.279 --> 04:39.519
and online shopping transactions.

62
04:39.720 --> 04:40.959
Most importantly,

63
04:41.439 --> 04:43.439
Qian Feng repeatedly bought elementary school

64
04:43.439 --> 04:47.160
tutoring materials and Barbie dolls.

65
04:47.800 --> 04:49.480
Elementary school tutoring materials?

66
04:50.000 --> 04:50.759
Barbie dolls?

67
04:53.040 --> 04:54.680
Qian Feng's...

68
04:55.439 --> 04:56.240
daughter.

69
05:00.600 --> 05:03.680
Is there a shipping address for his online orders?

70
05:05.000 --> 05:06.639
No. 356 Lang Street, Yangchuan City.

71
05:06.800 --> 05:08.240
The recipient is Qian Shu.

72
05:10.920 --> 05:12.639
One call to the Yangchuan Household Registry,

73
05:12.839 --> 05:15.199
and we can verify Qian Feng and his family.

74
05:15.399 --> 05:17.160
Like I need you to tell me? I checked already.

75
05:17.439 --> 05:18.720
Qian Feng, a native of Hubei.

76
05:18.720 --> 05:19.800
Went to college in Yangchuan.

77
05:19.800 --> 05:22.120
After graduating, he was a buyer at the First Auto Works

78
05:22.120 --> 05:22.879
for nearly 20 years.

79
05:23.120 --> 05:24.600
Five years ago, he went into business.

80
05:24.600 --> 05:26.920
His ex-wife, Li Liping, is a kindergarten teacher.

81
05:26.920 --> 05:27.879
They divorced three years ago.

82
05:28.160 --> 05:29.439
Custody was granted to Li Liping.

83
05:30.399 --> 05:31.759
By court ruling,

84
05:31.959 --> 05:35.240
Qian Feng only has visitation rights on weekends and holidays.

85
05:36.360 --> 05:36.759
So, what do you think?

86
05:37.240 --> 05:38.279
The day after tomorrow is the weekend.

87
05:38.480 --> 05:39.439
I think right now,

88
05:39.439 --> 05:40.879
we should book tickets to Yangchuan

89
05:40.879 --> 05:42.000
and bring Qian Feng in.

90
05:44.319 --> 05:45.480
Captain Lu even told me to go rest.

91
05:46.000 --> 05:47.319
I told you, without me,

92
05:47.319 --> 05:48.959
could our narcotics team even function?

93
05:50.519 --> 05:52.079
Keeping someone like you in the narcotics unit

94
05:52.199 --> 05:53.560
is truly a waste of your talents.

95
05:54.279 --> 05:55.480
You ought to be at the UN.

96
05:58.160 --> 05:58.759
No, no.

97
05:58.959 --> 06:00.319
Captain Lu, I'm doing fine right here.

98
06:00.480 --> 06:01.480
I'm a man of loyalty.

99
06:04.040 --> 06:05.360
What's up? Working hard, huh?

100
06:05.600 --> 06:06.839
Been playing with jigsaw puzzles here all day.

101
06:06.959 --> 06:07.560
No, not at all.

102
06:07.720 --> 06:09.240
Zhuang Yan begged me,

103
06:09.240 --> 06:11.279
begged me to sort these things out.

104
06:11.480 --> 06:12.279
If it weren't for him,

105
06:12.279 --> 06:13.560
I'd definitely follow your orders

106
06:13.560 --> 06:15.040
and go home to get some proper rest.

107
06:17.040 --> 06:18.959
Having you follow up on Qian Feng's case

108
06:19.279 --> 06:20.279
was Captain Lu's call.

109
06:23.800 --> 06:24.759
You still want to rest?

110
06:25.319 --> 06:25.920
Forget about it.

111
06:26.079 --> 06:28.040
First thing tomorrow morning, the three of you go to Yangchuan.

112
06:28.040 --> 06:29.600
I've already coordinated with the Yangchuan police.

113
06:29.600 --> 06:30.519
They'll assist you.

114
06:30.680 --> 06:32.839
On this trip, make sure you bring Qian Feng back.

115
06:33.240 --> 06:34.000
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

116
06:45.839 --> 06:46.319
Let's go.

117
06:46.560 --> 06:47.759
The boss is already waiting downstairs.

118
07:06.199 --> 07:06.839
Where are we going?

119
07:08.920 --> 07:09.439
Kai.

120
07:10.000 --> 07:12.279
You've seen all my venues lately,

121
07:12.519 --> 07:13.399
big and small, right?

122
07:14.199 --> 07:14.879
What do you think?

123
07:21.399 --> 07:24.480
The underworld is chaotic these days.

124
07:25.040 --> 07:26.680
Too many people don't respect the rules.

125
07:28.399 --> 07:30.360
We need to beef up our firepower.

126
07:32.199 --> 07:33.560
Boss had me source a cache of weapons.

127
07:33.800 --> 07:34.800
We're making the deal tonight.

128
07:36.279 --> 07:36.959
Are they reliable?

129
07:39.120 --> 07:40.000
What's their background?

130
07:41.000 --> 07:42.319
How would I know?

131
07:42.680 --> 07:43.800
It's my first time dealing with them.

132
07:44.040 --> 07:45.240
Don't worry, Kai.

133
07:45.439 --> 07:46.959
In a bit, the two of us will go in first.

134
07:47.800 --> 07:49.439
You two wait outside.

135
07:49.759 --> 07:50.879
Once we see the goods,

136
07:51.000 --> 07:51.839
bring the cash inside.

137
07:58.079 --> 07:58.439
Let's go.

138
08:07.079 --> 08:09.160
Then we interrogate Mu Qing first thing tomorrow.

139
08:11.920 --> 08:13.439
Only by finding Li Qiang

140
08:13.680 --> 08:15.759
can we possibly track down Ma Jingrong.

141
08:17.839 --> 08:19.240
Drug syndicates like these

142
08:19.240 --> 08:20.800
are always intricately connected.

143
08:21.720 --> 08:23.439
Maybe we can

144
08:23.439 --> 08:24.959
look into the logistics group's drug case

145
08:25.240 --> 08:26.279
to dig up more leads.

146
08:34.720 --> 08:37.960
Liang Wenbiao is buying guns from traffickers tonight.

147
08:41.200 --> 08:42.759
If he's buying guns now,

148
08:43.720 --> 08:45.279
it means he'll make his move soon.

149
08:50.679 --> 08:51.799
We can't touch Liang Wenbiao.

150
08:54.159 --> 08:55.039
Alert the criminal investigation team.

151
08:55.600 --> 08:56.720
Once tonight's deal goes down,

152
08:56.919 --> 08:58.840
have them bust the gun traffickers.

153
08:58.840 --> 09:00.320
I'll send the time and location separately.

154
09:05.879 --> 09:07.080
This intel of yours...

155
09:11.440 --> 09:12.000
You know how it is.

156
09:45.919 --> 09:46.399
What do you want?

157
09:48.519 --> 09:49.200
Flying Fish sent us.

158
09:49.679 --> 09:50.639
It's all cleared with your boss.

159
09:51.679 --> 09:52.519
We've been waiting forever.

160
09:53.159 --> 09:53.559
Come on in.

161
09:58.120 --> 09:58.720
Wait for my call.

162
10:30.360 --> 10:30.840
Any takers?

163
10:31.120 --> 10:32.679
Boss, they're here.

164
10:33.919 --> 10:34.879
What took you so long?

165
10:35.120 --> 10:36.840
Don't you have any sense of time?

166
10:37.919 --> 10:39.200
Traffic, Uncle Bird.

167
10:39.759 --> 10:40.759
Double Jokers!

168
10:41.039 --> 10:42.200
I'm out!

169
10:42.559 --> 10:43.720
Boss, what kind of hand is that?

170
10:43.720 --> 10:44.639
That's insane.

171
10:44.639 --> 10:45.720
Come on, pay up, pay up!

172
10:45.879 --> 10:47.679
Boss, three double Jokers in a row?

173
10:47.840 --> 10:49.120
Did you rig the deal?

174
10:49.360 --> 10:50.080
Rig my ass!

175
10:50.120 --> 10:51.960
You lost, so pay up and own it!

176
10:51.960 --> 10:52.360
Hurry up.

177
10:52.840 --> 10:54.200
Since Uncle Bird is so busy,

178
10:54.720 --> 10:56.080
we can make the deal another day.

179
10:57.279 --> 10:57.759
Let's go.

180
11:00.879 --> 11:02.519
What's your connection to Flying Fish?

181
11:20.600 --> 11:21.799
He's just one of my lackeys.

182
11:23.840 --> 11:24.679
Tell me something useful.

183
11:28.159 --> 11:29.759
He gets his supply from me.

184
11:31.600 --> 11:34.559
I just wanted to see if you're in the game.

185
11:36.039 --> 11:38.559
Ever since I watched Infernal Affairs,

186
11:38.960 --> 11:43.000
everyone looks like an undercover cop to me.

187
11:48.000 --> 11:49.519
Can't be too careful.

188
11:50.879 --> 11:52.440
You're wise to be cautious, Uncle Bird.

189
11:54.159 --> 11:54.960
Then again,

190
11:58.080 --> 11:59.000
cops

191
12:00.120 --> 12:01.600
don't usually carry stuff like this.

192
12:10.519 --> 12:11.480
I don't use this.

193
12:14.080 --> 12:15.240
It's bad for the brain.

194
12:20.240 --> 12:20.679
Where's the money?

195
12:21.519 --> 12:22.000
I brought it.

196
12:23.559 --> 12:25.200
But I want to see the goods first.

197
13:01.840 --> 13:02.639
Take a look.

198
13:04.399 --> 13:06.279
All brought in from the outside.

199
13:08.039 --> 13:09.080
Good stuff.

200
13:28.639 --> 13:29.519
Pretty slick.

201
13:31.320 --> 13:31.879
You flatter me.

202
13:37.000 --> 13:37.919
A real talent.

203
13:43.000 --> 13:43.600
Where's the money?

204
13:56.440 --> 13:57.440
Bring the money in.

205
13:58.080 --> 13:58.399
Got it.

206
14:15.080 --> 14:15.559
Boss

207
15:02.360 --> 15:03.279
We're all settled.

208
15:04.000 --> 15:05.120
Until next time.

209
15:06.000 --> 15:06.799
I won't see you out.

210
15:24.879 --> 15:25.399
My apologies.

211
15:26.679 --> 15:27.159
Really, sorry.

212
15:28.919 --> 15:32.279
Things are too hot lately. Can't be too careful.

213
15:33.240 --> 15:34.399
Even if you are cops,

214
15:34.399 --> 15:35.639
at least you'll die for a noble cause.

215
15:37.480 --> 15:38.240
The three of you...

216
15:38.960 --> 15:40.320
have found a decent resting place.

217
15:41.440 --> 15:42.519
What's that saying again?

218
15:42.759 --> 15:43.679
Something about...

219
15:43.879 --> 15:46.799
getting a monument and dying a hero.

220
15:47.679 --> 15:49.080
You have a death wish?

221
15:50.600 --> 15:51.600
Who are you cussing at?

222
16:00.799 --> 16:01.720
Do you like money?

223
16:02.320 --> 16:03.120
Let me go,

224
16:03.519 --> 16:04.519
and the cash is all yours.

225
16:05.000 --> 16:05.600
Yeah, yeah, alright.

226
16:06.639 --> 16:07.840
Cut the bullshit.

227
16:08.480 --> 16:10.320
I take what I'm owed.

228
16:10.320 --> 16:12.600
What isn't mine, I won't touch a dime of it.

229
16:13.000 --> 16:15.320
The thing is, I'm out of the game.

230
16:15.320 --> 16:18.080
Why the hell are you bringing me cash?

231
16:20.240 --> 16:23.159
I just don't want the gunshots drawing the cops.

232
16:24.120 --> 16:25.000
Who were you cussing at just now?

233
16:26.600 --> 16:28.159
Think I won't shoot you dead?

234
16:34.080 --> 16:34.600
Move in!

235
17:03.200 --> 17:03.840
Nobody move!

236
17:07.119 --> 17:08.119
Dana, grab the money!

237
17:12.200 --> 17:12.559
Move!

238
17:15.759 --> 17:16.160
Move!

239
17:17.319 --> 17:17.920
Go!

240
17:25.720 --> 17:26.359
Yang Wei!

241
17:28.960 --> 17:29.559
Yang Wei!

242
17:33.799 --> 17:34.400
Drive!

243
18:19.839 --> 18:21.039
Mr. Jiang, he's here.

244
18:26.680 --> 18:27.559
Hello, Mr. Jiang.

245
18:29.359 --> 18:31.279
This is Mr. Ma from the mainland.

246
18:32.720 --> 18:33.759
Hello, Mr. Ma.

247
18:33.799 --> 18:35.200
Hello, Mr. Jiang. Pleased to meet you.

248
18:37.000 --> 18:37.799
Please, have a seat.

249
18:37.799 --> 18:38.720
Come, please.

250
18:45.400 --> 18:46.759
I've already prepared the tea for you.

251
18:47.119 --> 18:48.039
Come, try some.

252
18:48.599 --> 18:49.000
All right.

253
18:58.599 --> 19:01.119
The locals here love iced tea.

254
19:01.359 --> 19:02.759
I've been here for over a decade,

255
19:03.079 --> 19:04.200
and I've picked up the habit, too.

256
19:04.680 --> 19:05.319
I wonder...

257
19:06.920 --> 19:08.240
if it suits your taste.

258
19:10.279 --> 19:11.559
Your iced tea, Mr. Jiang,

259
19:11.880 --> 19:14.480
is made from only the finest ingredients.

260
19:14.680 --> 19:16.240
Naturally, it tastes great.

261
19:23.119 --> 19:25.759
Doing business is just like drinking tea.

262
19:26.799 --> 19:27.759
If you pick the right tea leaves,

263
19:28.079 --> 19:30.359
it always hits the spot.

264
19:31.559 --> 19:33.680
There are several drug lords here in Jiechan State.

265
19:33.680 --> 19:36.839
I believe you know that well, Mr. Ma.

266
19:38.000 --> 19:39.960
And you should also understand

267
19:39.960 --> 19:40.920
that Mr. Tilade

268
19:41.920 --> 19:44.720
doesn't want to see our chosen partner

269
19:46.519 --> 19:47.640
doing any business

270
19:48.839 --> 19:50.160
with other drug lords.

271
19:57.359 --> 19:59.960
Lately, there's a newcomer on the street

272
20:00.240 --> 20:01.000
named Xiang Dong,

273
20:01.640 --> 20:02.680
nicknamed Piyazi.

274
20:03.119 --> 20:06.720
I heard you've been quite close with him, Mr. Ma.

275
20:10.319 --> 20:12.559
I understand your point, Mr. Jiang.

276
20:13.119 --> 20:16.240
Since I've chosen to do business with Mr. Tilade,

277
20:16.960 --> 20:18.920
I can assure you right now

278
20:20.640 --> 20:23.519
that my people will act quickly

279
20:23.680 --> 20:25.599
to cut ties with Piyazi once and for all.

280
20:27.640 --> 20:29.079
But I've heard Piyazi

281
20:30.480 --> 20:31.440
is ruthless,

282
20:31.680 --> 20:32.720
just like a mad dog.

283
20:34.279 --> 20:36.279
Aren't you afraid that working with us

284
20:37.240 --> 20:38.799
might bring fatal trouble upon yourself?

285
20:39.559 --> 20:42.000
Since I'm in this line of business,

286
20:42.880 --> 20:44.400
I'm not scared of any mad dog.

287
20:46.119 --> 20:47.440
Rest assured, Mr. Jiang.

288
20:48.440 --> 20:51.680
I'll take care of Piyazi as soon as possible.

289
20:56.240 --> 20:58.720
Since you're so determined, Mr. Ma,

290
20:59.880 --> 21:03.519
let's play big then.

291
21:12.960 --> 21:14.759
You must know better than I do, Mr. Ma,

292
21:14.759 --> 21:15.799
that in our line of work,

293
21:16.039 --> 21:18.640
the risk is the same whether you go big or small.

294
21:19.480 --> 21:22.599
Since we've decided to work together long-term,

295
21:23.200 --> 21:26.359
why bother testing each other? Right?

296
21:28.160 --> 21:28.640
It's pointless.

297
21:32.079 --> 21:33.200
For the first deal,

298
21:36.039 --> 21:37.799
I'll give you 50 kilos, Mr. Ma.

299
21:38.920 --> 21:40.720
I wonder if you have the appetite

300
21:40.720 --> 21:41.920
to swallow that much.

301
21:44.240 --> 21:46.000
With my current distribution channels,

302
21:46.640 --> 21:47.559
in two weeks,

303
21:47.960 --> 21:50.480
I'll come see you with the cash, Mr. Jiang.

304
21:50.920 --> 21:51.720
One week.

305
21:54.400 --> 21:56.720
Whether we can collaborate long-term

306
21:57.480 --> 21:59.079
depends on how cleanly

307
21:59.079 --> 22:00.279
you handle this deal, Mr. Ma.

308
22:01.680 --> 22:05.440
Since you think so highly of me, Mr. Jiang,

309
22:07.559 --> 22:09.640
we'll do it your way.

310
22:21.319 --> 22:24.319
Someone will take the goods to meet Mr. Ma tomorrow.

311
22:24.839 --> 22:26.400
I hope that in a week,

312
22:26.960 --> 22:30.400
I will see Mr. Ma right here with the cash,

313
22:30.720 --> 22:31.640
meeting with me.

314
22:33.960 --> 22:37.319
Besides, this was decided rather quickly,

315
22:39.680 --> 22:41.400
so I imagine Mr. Ma

316
22:42.200 --> 22:44.200
hasn't had time to make arrangements for his wife.

317
22:44.559 --> 22:45.319
How about this?

318
22:47.119 --> 22:49.839
Let your wife stay with me for the time being.

319
22:50.359 --> 22:51.680
I will have someone

320
22:51.839 --> 22:54.319
take good care of her for you.

321
22:54.880 --> 22:55.519
How does that sound?

322
23:00.559 --> 23:01.200
I know

323
23:03.039 --> 23:05.920
not many people get to meet Mr. Jiang.

324
23:07.319 --> 23:10.000
But no matter what,

325
23:11.240 --> 23:13.799
I won't let my wife, because of me,

326
23:13.799 --> 23:15.440
risk her life.

327
23:17.440 --> 23:17.920
Goodbye.

328
23:22.720 --> 23:24.160
Then it's farewell for good.

329
23:31.599 --> 23:32.519
What's that supposed to mean?

330
23:33.440 --> 23:34.039
Mr. Ma,

331
23:35.640 --> 23:37.000
we're both in this line of work.

332
23:37.240 --> 23:39.160
You should know better than anyone:

333
23:41.519 --> 23:42.960
once you step onto this ship,

334
23:44.000 --> 23:45.720
you can't just get off

335
23:45.720 --> 23:46.799
whenever you feel like it.

336
23:47.400 --> 23:49.480
Mr. Tilade thinks very highly of you, Mr. Ma.

337
23:50.200 --> 23:52.200
But I still need to see

338
23:53.079 --> 23:54.640
your capability and your sincerity.

339
24:03.759 --> 24:05.319
This is my first time in Country M.

340
24:05.880 --> 24:07.880
I'd actually love to stay and look around for a few days.

341
24:22.839 --> 24:23.519
In one week,

342
24:25.559 --> 24:26.759
I'll bring the money to meet you.

343
24:28.720 --> 24:30.400
We have a deal, Mr. Jiang.

344
24:32.960 --> 24:34.400
If my wife

345
24:35.519 --> 24:37.319
suffers the slightest harm,

346
24:37.359 --> 24:39.480
I won't let this go easily.

347
24:50.319 --> 24:50.960
I'll take my leave.

348
25:46.200 --> 25:47.759
Five-star hotels really are something else.

349
25:48.200 --> 25:49.519
We can even watch TV from back home.

350
25:49.920 --> 25:51.920
Just a few lousy channels. What's so good about that?

351
25:52.240 --> 25:53.400
We've been in Country M for so long,

352
25:53.559 --> 25:55.079
but the boss hasn't even taken us out for fun.

353
25:56.480 --> 25:57.319
Tell me about it.

354
26:00.599 --> 26:01.359
Boss is back.

355
26:04.559 --> 26:05.039
Boss. Boss.

356
26:21.759 --> 26:22.640
Boss, what's the deal here?

357
26:25.400 --> 26:26.480
We thought our trip to Country M

358
26:26.480 --> 26:27.559
would go smoothly,

359
26:28.000 --> 26:29.200
but who knew Jiang Liye

360
26:29.200 --> 26:30.559
would use your wife to threaten you!

361
26:33.839 --> 26:34.240
Mr. Qin.

362
26:34.920 --> 26:35.799
Doesn't this Jiang Liye

363
26:35.799 --> 26:37.319
work for Mr. Tilade?

364
26:37.359 --> 26:37.680
Why is it that

365
26:37.960 --> 26:39.240
we passed Mr. Tilade's test,

366
26:39.359 --> 26:40.480
yet he's pulling this stunt now?

367
26:42.400 --> 26:43.640
Tilade and Jiang Liye...

368
26:43.799 --> 26:45.079
One's just playing good cop,

369
26:45.079 --> 26:46.279
and the other's playing bad cop.

370
26:46.480 --> 26:47.960
In my view, if things

371
26:48.440 --> 26:49.599
had gone too smoothly,

372
26:49.720 --> 26:51.880
it wouldn't be a good sign for us.

373
26:53.839 --> 26:55.240
Though things look bad right now,

374
26:55.640 --> 26:56.680
it just proves

375
26:56.680 --> 26:58.079
Tilade really wants us

376
26:58.359 --> 26:59.559
to move goods into the mainland for him.

377
27:00.519 --> 27:02.240
The only reason Jiang Liye kept Miss Li

378
27:02.240 --> 27:02.880
behind this time

379
27:03.079 --> 27:05.839
is that he still doesn't trust us.

380
27:07.519 --> 27:08.880
He won't lay a finger on Miss Li.

381
27:08.920 --> 27:09.960
I'm certain of that.

382
27:10.319 --> 27:10.799
Still,

383
27:12.079 --> 27:13.279
our major buyers

384
27:13.279 --> 27:14.599
have been very cautious lately.

385
27:14.920 --> 27:17.400
Even if someone takes this much stock at once,

386
27:17.599 --> 27:19.000
the timeline is extremely tight.

387
27:20.160 --> 27:22.960
I have plans for the buyers.

388
27:25.400 --> 27:25.920
Lao Qin,

389
27:26.319 --> 27:27.440
once we get the goods tomorrow,

390
27:27.839 --> 27:29.119
arrange for Yunfei and me to leave the country.

391
27:30.400 --> 27:31.400
Now, continuing our news coverage.

392
27:31.640 --> 27:34.200
Yesterday, Nanhai police launched a special anti-drug raid,

393
27:34.519 --> 27:36.960
cracking a major drug trafficking case.

394
27:37.559 --> 27:40.119
Chief suspect Mu Qing and his accomplices,

395
27:40.160 --> 27:42.160
Wang Sanyang, He Xiangrong, and others,

396
27:42.480 --> 27:44.000
have been arrested by the police.

397
27:44.559 --> 27:45.960
Another suspect, Li Qiang,

398
27:45.960 --> 27:47.240
is currently wanted by the police.

399
27:47.680 --> 27:48.359
In this operation,

400
27:48.359 --> 27:50.880
two million yuan in illicit drug money

401
27:51.240 --> 27:52.319
and five kilograms of narcotics were seized.

402
27:52.839 --> 27:55.039
It is the largest drug case

403
27:55.079 --> 27:56.240
cracked in Nanhai in the past two years.

404
27:57.720 --> 27:59.400
No wonder I couldn't reach Brother Qiang yesterday.

405
28:00.759 --> 28:01.400
Boss,

406
28:02.039 --> 28:02.960
with such a huge mess,

407
28:03.400 --> 28:04.359
why didn't Brother Qiang

408
28:04.359 --> 28:05.400
give us a call?

409
28:10.119 --> 28:10.920
What do we do now?

410
28:13.039 --> 28:13.960
We can't stay in Nanhai.

411
28:17.200 --> 28:17.920
Contact Ah Qiang.

412
28:18.559 --> 28:20.400
Tell him to offload his stock as soon as possible,

413
28:20.640 --> 28:21.759
and then head to Country M.

414
28:21.759 --> 28:23.240
Next, we will broadcast again

415
28:23.359 --> 28:24.920
the suspect information released by the police.

416
28:25.440 --> 28:26.799
Li Qiang, 35 years old.

417
28:27.000 --> 28:28.359
Height: 1.78 meters.

418
28:28.559 --> 28:30.880
Weight: approx. 70 kilograms, athletic build.

419
28:31.640 --> 28:33.079
Mai Wendi, 28 years old.

420
28:33.599 --> 28:34.960
Height: approx. 1.78 meters.

421
28:35.200 --> 28:37.839
Weight: approx. 65 kilograms, slim build.

422
28:38.240 --> 28:39.400
If members of the public spot

423
28:39.400 --> 28:41.000
anyone matching these descriptions,

424
28:41.119 --> 28:42.799
please notify the police immediately.

425
28:43.039 --> 28:45.599
Didn't you say you'd play a few rounds with me?

426
28:45.839 --> 28:47.160
How did you end up on TV so soon?

427
28:48.720 --> 28:50.119
Come on, have a drink.

428
28:56.920 --> 28:57.319
Speak.

429
28:57.599 --> 28:58.759
The boss called.

430
28:59.559 --> 29:01.440
Asking when we'll deal with Qian.

431
29:02.079 --> 29:04.319
Don't you have plenty of men under you?

432
29:04.799 --> 29:06.440
Why dump this job on me?

433
29:06.759 --> 29:07.960
It's the boss's orders.

434
29:08.519 --> 29:10.400
The boss knows you botched it last time,

435
29:11.680 --> 29:13.839
so you'd better take care of it fast.

436
29:14.200 --> 29:16.359
You think I don't want to wrap this up quickly?

437
29:17.039 --> 29:19.000
Why do you educated folks

438
29:19.319 --> 29:21.039
always love beating around the bush?

439
29:21.920 --> 29:22.759
Fine, fine.

440
29:23.039 --> 29:24.480
Give me two days. Wait for my call.

441
29:30.599 --> 29:30.920
Ah Li.

442
29:32.920 --> 29:33.240
Brother Four.

443
29:35.119 --> 29:36.039
Get in touch with Guangzai.

444
29:36.319 --> 29:37.160
See where he is.

445
29:37.640 --> 29:38.359
Got it, Brother Four.

446
29:47.759 --> 29:49.799
Your subordinate provided this list.

447
29:50.319 --> 29:52.640
He already confessed to all your crimes.

448
29:53.559 --> 29:55.319
Since you already know everything,

449
29:55.440 --> 29:56.319
why bother asking me?

450
29:56.640 --> 29:58.319
We need you to confirm if anything was missed.

451
30:04.079 --> 30:05.960
My subordinate confessed to everything.

452
30:06.119 --> 30:08.720
That counts as cooperating.

453
30:09.119 --> 30:10.519
I hope the judge will go easy on him.

454
30:11.039 --> 30:11.759
As for me...

455
30:13.400 --> 30:14.759
Sentence me however you see fit.

456
30:15.359 --> 30:16.480
I'll plead guilty and accept the punishment.

457
30:20.920 --> 30:22.359
The people on this list

458
30:23.000 --> 30:25.079
are only some of the ones you dealt with.

459
30:28.200 --> 30:29.440
The bosses behind them...

460
30:30.079 --> 30:31.440
you should know them better than anyone.

461
30:34.960 --> 30:36.680
I know what's on your mind.

462
30:37.119 --> 30:39.079
You know you've committed a serious crime,

463
30:40.000 --> 30:41.160
and there's no chance of sentence reduction.

464
30:41.319 --> 30:44.559
So you choose to protect

465
30:44.559 --> 30:45.880
the people who once helped you.

466
30:46.079 --> 30:48.400
But I hope you think it through carefully.

467
30:48.920 --> 30:50.480
Reaching this point today...

468
30:50.799 --> 30:52.680
Did those people who once helped you

469
30:53.200 --> 30:54.640
really help you,

470
30:56.039 --> 30:57.480
or did they actually ruin you?

471
30:59.640 --> 31:02.039
The officer who questioned you earlier told me

472
31:02.240 --> 31:03.359
you said you wanted

473
31:04.079 --> 31:06.079
to enjoy whatever time you have left.

474
31:07.079 --> 31:09.079
While you still have time,

475
31:09.079 --> 31:10.480
have you considered doing something meaningful?

476
31:11.960 --> 31:13.160
After all this talk,

477
31:13.799 --> 31:15.079
you just want me to rat people out.

478
31:15.519 --> 31:17.599
It's a chance to make amends.

479
31:18.440 --> 31:19.880
Do you know that because of you,

480
31:20.519 --> 31:22.680
countless families have been torn apart?

481
31:23.400 --> 31:25.359
And how many people, because of you,

482
31:25.480 --> 31:27.519
lost their chance at a good life?

483
31:28.039 --> 31:29.160
Don't you feel any remorse?

484
31:32.160 --> 31:35.400
You think I forced them to take drugs?

485
31:35.880 --> 31:36.799
To you,

486
31:37.079 --> 31:39.839
drugs are contraband, poison.

487
31:40.559 --> 31:41.720
But to me,

488
31:43.000 --> 31:44.160
it's just business.

489
31:44.759 --> 31:46.759
They want it, I supply it.

490
31:46.920 --> 31:49.119
I don't feel there's anything to regret.

491
31:52.720 --> 31:53.720
There's actually one thing

492
31:53.720 --> 31:55.200
I've never quite understood.

493
31:56.680 --> 31:57.480
Your father

494
31:59.400 --> 32:00.960
is a nationally renowned entrepreneur.

495
32:03.640 --> 32:05.279
With everything he could give you

496
32:05.279 --> 32:06.720
and your own achievements,

497
32:09.319 --> 32:10.240
your future

498
32:11.920 --> 32:12.799
would have been bright.

499
32:13.400 --> 32:15.599
Money, social status,

500
32:16.319 --> 32:18.519
even the limelight from the media...

501
32:19.079 --> 32:21.240
things ordinary people could never dream of.

502
32:23.160 --> 32:25.559
Why choose the path of drug trafficking?

503
32:25.920 --> 32:26.559
Let me tell you.

504
32:26.559 --> 32:27.960
I did it purely for the thrill.

505
32:27.960 --> 32:28.799
Believe it or not.

506
32:32.759 --> 32:33.839
And as for my father...

507
32:34.480 --> 32:36.599
You think he'd leave everything he has

508
32:36.599 --> 32:37.599
to me?

509
32:38.559 --> 32:40.000
My parents have two kids.

510
32:40.640 --> 32:43.319
I have an older brother with a Harvard PhD.

511
32:43.680 --> 32:44.759
In my father's eyes,

512
32:44.759 --> 32:47.640
I've always been the disobedient one

513
32:47.799 --> 32:49.039
who caused trouble everywhere.

514
32:50.640 --> 32:51.480
Growing up,

515
32:51.480 --> 32:52.519
my father always predicted

516
32:52.519 --> 32:54.440
that I'd end up like this.

517
32:55.160 --> 32:56.599
My ending up like this

518
32:56.839 --> 32:59.240
was no surprise to them at all.

519
33:01.359 --> 33:04.359
They got what they wished for.

520
33:04.720 --> 33:06.480
I don't believe you ended up here

521
33:06.480 --> 33:08.000
just because of what your father said.

522
33:08.680 --> 33:09.920
I'd rather believe

523
33:10.160 --> 33:11.960
you wanted your father's attention,

524
33:14.119 --> 33:15.319
or even his approval.

525
33:19.039 --> 33:20.519
You just chose the wrong way.

526
33:21.119 --> 33:21.720
Whatever.

527
33:22.599 --> 33:23.759
I've had my fun.

528
33:24.319 --> 33:24.839
It was worth it.

529
33:31.960 --> 33:33.400
Before I came here today,

530
33:33.960 --> 33:36.000
I had my officers contact your parents.

531
33:36.240 --> 33:37.759
I wanted them to talk you into cooperating.

532
33:39.400 --> 33:40.799
But they can't make it now.

533
33:42.319 --> 33:43.799
Of course they wouldn't come.

534
33:44.000 --> 33:46.839
I'm sure my father has already drafted a statement,

535
33:47.240 --> 33:49.200
ready to announce to all the media

536
33:49.599 --> 33:51.759
that he's disowning me.

537
33:54.440 --> 33:56.079
We got word from your mother.

538
33:56.279 --> 33:57.079
Your father...

539
33:58.799 --> 34:00.759
after seeing the news reports about you,

540
34:01.119 --> 34:03.240
had a sudden cerebral hemorrhage and was hospitalized.

541
34:07.440 --> 34:08.119
What did you say?

542
34:09.239 --> 34:10.039
He was hospitalized?

543
34:10.920 --> 34:12.000
How is he doing now?

544
34:13.719 --> 34:14.599
Half an hour ago...

545
34:17.079 --> 34:17.719
he passed away.

546
34:18.360 --> 34:18.960
That's impossible.

547
34:20.880 --> 34:21.840
You're lying to me.

548
34:22.000 --> 34:22.840
You're lying to me, aren't you?

549
34:23.440 --> 34:24.639
You're lying to me, aren't you?!

550
34:25.320 --> 34:26.559
He's always been healthy.

551
34:26.800 --> 34:27.880
Nothing could happen to him!

552
34:28.840 --> 34:30.440
He's always been in good health!

553
34:32.480 --> 34:33.559
You're just lying to me.

554
34:33.599 --> 34:35.400
You're just lying to me, aren't you?!

555
34:36.000 --> 34:38.199
Tell me you're lying to me.

556
34:38.400 --> 34:39.599
Just tell me that you're lying,

557
34:39.599 --> 34:41.079
and I'll tell you everything!

558
34:41.599 --> 34:42.920
You know I wouldn't lie to you.

559
34:43.079 --> 34:44.519
Now you should realize

560
34:44.800 --> 34:46.000
in your father's heart...

561
34:47.320 --> 34:48.559
just how much you truly mattered.

562
35:14.239 --> 35:16.239
According to Mu Qing and Li Yawei's statements,

563
35:16.519 --> 35:18.000
before coming to Nanhai,

564
35:18.159 --> 35:19.320
Mu Qing had contacted someone

565
35:19.320 --> 35:20.679
nicknamed Four-Legged Snake.

566
35:21.199 --> 35:23.039
They had already reached a deal,

567
35:23.199 --> 35:24.360
but Four-Legged Snake's shipment

568
35:24.559 --> 35:25.639
suddenly ran into an issue,

569
35:25.880 --> 35:27.360
so she contacted Li Qiang instead.

570
35:28.199 --> 35:29.119
We suspect that

571
35:29.400 --> 35:32.400
the goods Four-Legged Snake was to supply

572
35:32.559 --> 35:34.440
is what we found at the logistics company,

573
35:34.440 --> 35:35.840
the seized No. 4 heroin.

574
35:36.079 --> 35:37.039
But all of this

575
35:37.280 --> 35:38.800
requires finding Qian Feng

576
35:38.840 --> 35:39.960
before it can be confirmed.

577
35:42.280 --> 35:43.840
Sort out the suspects' interrogation records

578
35:43.920 --> 35:45.800
and send them to the relevant department ASAP.

579
35:45.800 --> 35:46.320
Understood.

580
35:47.840 --> 35:49.000
Have Zhuang Yan and his team left?

581
35:49.480 --> 35:50.800
Their bullet train was at nine this morning.

582
35:51.000 --> 35:52.039
They should be arriving soon.

583
36:07.199 --> 36:07.920
Your phone.

584
36:09.960 --> 36:10.480
Ex-military?

585
36:12.760 --> 36:13.719
That was ten years ago.

586
36:13.960 --> 36:15.800
Why, did you serve too?

587
36:16.079 --> 36:16.480
No.

588
36:16.679 --> 36:18.360
I used to work in a military clinic.

589
36:18.639 --> 36:20.360
I'm used to hands that have held guns.

590
36:29.280 --> 36:31.400
Yangchuan CID has sent officers to Li Liping's home

591
36:31.400 --> 36:32.800
and to stake out near Qian Shu's school.

592
36:33.880 --> 36:34.880
As soon as Qian Feng shows up,

593
36:35.679 --> 36:36.760
they'll move in and arrest him.

594
36:37.679 --> 36:39.519
Are you sure that once he shows up,

595
36:39.960 --> 36:41.559
we'll definitely get the chance to catch him?

596
36:42.480 --> 36:43.280
Are you worried

597
36:43.559 --> 36:45.679
someone will help him escape again?

598
36:48.119 --> 36:49.880
I have a feeling that suspect from last time

599
36:50.320 --> 36:51.400
will show up again.

600
36:52.199 --> 36:54.239
But whether he's helping Qian Feng escape

601
36:54.599 --> 36:55.519
or has another agenda,

602
36:56.760 --> 36:57.840
I can't be sure right now.

603
36:58.400 --> 36:59.199
What do you mean, then?

604
37:02.119 --> 37:03.880
Ever since we started tracing Psychedelic Blues,

605
37:04.320 --> 37:05.559
every single lead we uncover

606
37:05.599 --> 37:06.719
gets deliberately cut off.

607
37:08.280 --> 37:09.800
If we want to know what this suspect's

608
37:09.920 --> 37:11.360
true motive is

609
37:11.519 --> 37:13.079
for staying close to Qian Feng,

610
37:13.840 --> 37:15.199
I'm afraid we'll have to catch him first.

611
37:17.119 --> 37:18.440
If that's the case,

612
37:18.840 --> 37:20.159
the person pulling the suspect's strings

613
37:20.280 --> 37:22.199
must be Qian Feng's accomplice,

614
37:22.400 --> 37:23.320
or his Supplier.

615
37:23.679 --> 37:24.480
Because only then

616
37:24.599 --> 37:25.599
could he stay one step ahead of us

617
37:25.800 --> 37:26.800
and know Qian Feng's every move.

618
37:30.960 --> 37:32.039
The suspect's sketch—

619
37:32.159 --> 37:33.039
how's it going?

620
37:38.440 --> 37:39.199
I've tried many times,

621
37:40.960 --> 37:42.239
but I'm feeling less and less certain.

622
37:44.159 --> 37:44.880
What's the issue?

623
37:46.199 --> 37:46.920
It's on me.

624
37:50.320 --> 37:51.840
Do you need me, or a psychologist?

625
37:57.039 --> 37:57.599
No need.

626
37:58.679 --> 37:59.239
I'll try again.

627
38:01.239 --> 38:01.679
Let's go.

628
38:03.639 --> 38:03.840
Zhou Fuhai said...

629
38:03.840 --> 38:04.679
Zhou Fuhai said

630
38:04.679 --> 38:06.320
his company only offers door-to-door delivery

631
38:06.320 --> 38:07.719
to contracted clients.

632
38:09.000 --> 38:11.239
Yet Zhongtian's long-term contracted clients

633
38:11.239 --> 38:12.639
usually have low shipping volumes.

634
38:12.800 --> 38:15.400
There are three companies like Gao Min's

635
38:15.599 --> 38:16.480
with very few orders.

636
38:17.119 --> 38:18.159
I don't think they warrant

637
38:18.159 --> 38:19.159
such priority from Zhongtian.

638
38:21.960 --> 38:23.880
You suspect someone at Zhongtian

639
38:24.000 --> 38:25.719
is colluding with Gao Min?

640
38:27.119 --> 38:29.159
Besides Gao Min's beauty care center,

641
38:29.159 --> 38:31.280
there's Yike Gifts and the Chaoqing Online Store.

642
38:31.519 --> 38:33.880
Could it all just be a coincidence?

643
38:35.800 --> 38:37.159
Long-term contracts...

644
38:37.320 --> 38:38.920
I think both of those companies are suspicious.

645
38:39.119 --> 38:40.039
Suspicious too?

646
38:41.480 --> 38:43.199
Yet the one who signed contracts with these clients

647
38:43.400 --> 38:44.559
was Zhou Fuhai himself.

648
38:45.000 --> 38:47.480
He's Zhongtian Logistics branch's admin director.

649
38:47.639 --> 38:49.480
Besides, with so many orders,

650
38:49.679 --> 38:51.679
everyone at the logistics firm sees them.

651
38:52.119 --> 38:53.599
If they're colluding,

652
38:53.800 --> 38:54.880
the risk would be far too high.

653
38:55.039 --> 38:56.000
As long as the profits are huge enough,

654
38:57.000 --> 38:58.519
someone will always take the gamble.

655
38:59.519 --> 39:01.480
And if I'm not mistaken,

656
39:02.920 --> 39:04.440
some higher-ups at Zhongtian Logistics

657
39:04.639 --> 39:06.119
have been compromised by the cartel

658
39:06.440 --> 39:08.519
to provide transit channels for drug smuggling.

659
39:08.800 --> 39:10.679
Then the cartel we're up against

660
39:10.800 --> 39:11.920
has serious power behind it.

661
39:12.119 --> 39:13.000
We'll definitely win.

662
39:19.199 --> 39:20.000
Are you looking at me?

663
39:23.199 --> 39:24.079
Do you have any idea

664
39:25.320 --> 39:26.840
that when you're focused on work,

665
39:27.880 --> 39:28.960
you're incredibly attractive?

666
39:34.079 --> 39:34.679
Really?

667
39:55.719 --> 39:56.800
I've actually been wondering,

668
39:57.039 --> 39:58.639
what's the suspect's real motive?

669
40:00.679 --> 40:01.239
Think about it.

670
40:02.440 --> 40:04.119
When Qian Feng saw the suspect,

671
40:04.119 --> 40:05.239
he looked shocked.

672
40:05.239 --> 40:07.039
It means they didn't even know each other.

673
40:07.559 --> 40:09.559
And if the drug syndicate wanted to silence him,

674
40:10.199 --> 40:11.280
wouldn't that be easy?

675
40:11.400 --> 40:12.000
Anyway,

676
40:13.000 --> 40:14.719
once the suspect shows up again,

677
40:14.719 --> 40:16.519
the truth will finally come to light.

678
40:17.239 --> 40:18.679
But none of us have seen him.

679
40:18.679 --> 40:19.519
If he does show up,

680
40:19.519 --> 40:20.599
how will we recognize him?

681
40:22.440 --> 40:23.000
Right.

682
40:23.599 --> 40:25.239
Hasn't Captain Bai been asking Captain Lu

683
40:25.440 --> 40:27.000
to sketch the suspect?

684
40:27.480 --> 40:30.239
I heard Captain Lu was once a police sketch artist.

685
40:30.800 --> 40:31.400
Is that true?

686
40:32.000 --> 40:32.559
It's true.

687
40:33.440 --> 40:35.039
Though that was many years ago.

688
40:36.599 --> 40:37.559
Chief Huang told me

689
40:37.960 --> 40:39.639
he was a top student at the art academy.

690
40:40.039 --> 40:41.559
Because of his talent for portrait sketching,

691
40:41.559 --> 40:42.679
he was specially recruited into the force.

692
40:43.119 --> 40:46.119
Back then, with his incredible sketches,

693
40:46.760 --> 40:48.440
he cracked numerous major cases.

694
40:48.480 --> 40:50.760
He even received commendations from the Department.

695
40:51.079 --> 40:52.039
Then later on,

696
40:52.920 --> 40:54.079
an accident happened,

697
40:54.239 --> 40:55.599
and he never picked up a pencil again.

698
40:58.079 --> 41:00.280
The suspect portrait Captain Lu drew back then

699
41:00.280 --> 41:02.119
wasn't the actual killer at all,

700
41:03.280 --> 41:05.159
yet it happened to look just like

701
41:05.159 --> 41:07.119
an innocent bystander at the crime scene.

702
41:08.480 --> 41:09.400
A witness insisted

703
41:09.760 --> 41:11.639
the bystander was the killer.

704
41:12.039 --> 41:13.679
When the police moved in to arrest him,

705
41:14.400 --> 41:16.559
the bystander panicked and ran,

706
41:17.400 --> 41:18.960
only to be hit by a car.

707
41:18.960 --> 41:19.880
Dad!

708
41:20.159 --> 41:21.760
My legs!

709
41:24.760 --> 41:25.599
Are you sure?

710
41:29.440 --> 41:30.960
My legs...

711
41:33.599 --> 41:34.719
He ended up in a wheelchair for life.

712
41:35.119 --> 41:35.960
Ever since that day,

713
41:37.199 --> 41:39.559
Captain Lu never had the courage to draw again.

714
41:54.280 --> 41:55.800
But hearing all this,

715
41:56.559 --> 41:58.079
it doesn't sound like Captain Lu's fault.

716
41:58.639 --> 41:59.960
The witness probably subconsciously

717
41:59.960 --> 42:01.159
distorted their own memory.

718
42:01.599 --> 42:03.159
Memory is easily influenced by others,

719
42:03.519 --> 42:05.079
and naturally prone to idealization.

720
42:05.679 --> 42:06.480
We always unconsciously

721
42:06.480 --> 42:07.599
alter our own memories.

722
42:08.400 --> 42:10.039
Just like a couple who are always late,

723
42:10.199 --> 42:11.760
each thinks the other

724
42:12.000 --> 42:12.960
is late more often.

725
42:14.760 --> 42:15.679
You're right.

726
42:17.599 --> 42:18.800
Captain Lu just puts

727
42:19.679 --> 42:20.800
all the blame on himself.

728
42:21.360 --> 42:22.400
Because the sketch he drew

729
42:22.400 --> 42:23.679
changed someone's life forever.

730
42:24.559 --> 42:25.559
When a tragedy happens,

731
42:26.760 --> 42:30.239
someone always has to take the blame.

732
42:34.199 --> 42:35.840
Height is roughly between 1.75

733
42:35.920 --> 42:37.159
and 1.80 meters.

734
42:37.320 --> 42:38.800
The chin is fairly wide,

735
42:39.119 --> 42:40.960
with eyes smaller than average,

736
42:41.679 --> 42:42.559
and a broad forehead.

737
42:43.840 --> 42:45.320
Dad, what's wrong?

738
42:45.480 --> 42:47.119
My leg... Dad, get up!

739
42:53.280 --> 42:54.119
We already checked.

740
42:54.239 --> 42:56.280
Zhang Junyan was just passing by the scene.

741
42:56.679 --> 42:58.480
The witness changed their story,

742
42:58.480 --> 42:59.440
saying they misremembered.

743
43:06.079 --> 43:07.199
If I hadn't,

744
43:07.800 --> 43:10.360
while the witness was unsure,

745
43:10.480 --> 43:11.679
guided their testimony,

746
43:14.880 --> 43:16.559
this tragedy wouldn't have happened.

747
43:47.320 --> 43:48.639
Do you have time to step out with me?

748
43:51.920 --> 43:52.800
Someone wants to see you.
